            "at": 48,
            "text": "Step one: read the market context before naming the pattern."
          },
          {
            "at": 72,
            "text": "Context determines whether a candle signal matters or should be ignored."
          },
          {
            "at": 96,
            "text": "Step two: inspect the body, the wicks, and the strength of the close."
          },
          {
            "at": 120,
            "text": "Focus on location, momentum, and price reaction instead of one isolated candle."
          },
          {
            "at": 144,
            "text": "Step three: wait for confirmation instead of predicting the next move."
          },
          {
            "at": 168,
            "text": "A useful setup needs a clear confirmation condition and a clear invalidation condition."
          },
